scriptdefs
= RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_EventScript_MrStone
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_RECEIVED_EXP_SHARE RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_EventScript_MrStoneAfterFavor
goto_if_set FLAG_DELIVERED_STEVEN_LETTER RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_EventScript_GiveExpShare
msgbox	MR. STONE: I'm counting on you!
closemessage
applymovement VAR_LAST_TALKED Common_Movement_FaceOriginalDirection
waitmovement 0
release
end
= RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_EventScript_GiveExpShare
msgbox	MR. STONE: You delivered my LETTER? Thank you kindly!This is my way of thanking you. It should help you, a TRAINER.
giveitem ITEM_EXP_SHARE
goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT FALSE Common_EventScript_ShowBagIsFull
setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_EXP_SHARE
msgbox	MR. STONE: A POKéMON holding that EXP. SHARE will be given some of the EXP Points from battle.It will get EXP Points even if it didn't actually battle.I would say EXP. SHARE is quite useful for raising weak POKéMON.
closemessage
applymovement VAR_LAST_TALKED Common_Movement_FaceOriginalDirection
waitmovement 0
release
end
= RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_EventScript_MrStoneAfterFavor
msgbox	MR. STONE: Since my youth, I've immersed myself in work.Consequently, I'm not familiar with trends and that sort of thing.But do young people all want to be TRAINERS in the POKéMON LEAGUE?
closemessage
applymovement VAR_LAST_TALKED Common_Movement_FaceOriginalDirection
waitmovement 0
release
end
= RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_EventScript_Employee
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_RECEIVED_REPEAT_BALL RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_EventScript_EmployeeBalls
msgbox	If you visit the SHIPYARD in SLATEPORT, you should go see CAPT. STERN.
release
end
= RustboroCity_DevonCorp_3F_EventScript_EmployeeBalls
msgbox	DEVON's new products, the REPEAT BALL and TIMER BALL, have become hugely popular among TRAINERS.
release
end
